1219:I'm definitely a bit of a sweaty mess... but seeing them all tucked away and tidy really makes my day.
1220:You're right. There's nothing like that "job well done" feeling...
1221:So, it's finally the weekend...
1222:Don't you have a shift at the cafe today?
1223:I was just heading out! But it's been so scorching lately, I couldn't focus on work knowing my plants were baking.
1224:Care to join me, {var:player_nickname}? Reina just got some fresh coffee beans in today!
1225:Sounds good. I could really use a cold drink to cool off.
1226:Then let's get moving! I'll personally make that first cup for you, {var:player_nickname}.
