1296:Ah! I-I mean... they provide shade and keep the air fresh and cool. Plus, aren't they just pretty?
1297:{var:player_nickname}... what do you think? Do you like it?
1298:Check out the plants
1299:Check out Hinata's face
1300:N-not me! I mean the plants in the yard...!
1301:They look so healthy. You've really poured your heart into this, haven't you?
1302:Wait... Are these little tags on the plants? Some old, some new, and some are even laminated. But that's not your writing, is it?
1303:My grandma wrote those. I've saved them all since I first started gardening with her.
1304:This one's from my 5th birthday. The other reminds me not to overwater the ball cactus...
1305:Hmm? That bunny succulent you brought back has a tag too. The color is different. Is it special?
1306:Oh! That's...!
1307:Take a closer look
1308:Wait for Hinata to finish
